                                                "sense_id": "87decf3d-4560-3a43-86e5-fe35db48c6d3",
                                                "text": "On the threshold of 1984, Communist rewriters of history have scored a significant victory in their longtime effort to erase inconvenient individuals and events from the chronicle of modern times."
